---
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>LUMA Studio — Demo</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" />

<style is:inline>
  :root {
    --paper: #faf4f0; --paper-2: #f1e4dc; --ink: #2b2420; --muted: #7c6f66;
    --rose: #b98a7d; --rose-d: #9d6f62; --gold: #c9a86a; --line: #e6d5cc;
    --serif: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    --sans: "Jost", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); line-height: 1.7; padding-top: 2.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

  .demobar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 999; height: 2.5rem; background: #08080A; color: #D9B45B; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.66rem; }
  .demobar b { color: #F7E7B6; }
  .demobar a { border-bottom: 1px solid #D9B45B; padding-bottom: 1px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .demobar span:last-child { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .demobar { font-size: 0.58rem; } .demobar b { display: none; } }

  .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3rem); }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 1rem 1.8rem; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--rose-d); }
  .btn--line { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .btn--line:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }

  header.site { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  header.site .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: 1.4rem; }
  .logo { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; padding-left: 0.28em; }
  header.site nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; font-size: 0.74rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  header.site nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { header.site nav { display: none; } }

  .hero .wrap { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 8rem); text-align: center; }
  .hero .eyebrow { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.34em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rose); }
  .hero h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: 0.01em; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--rose); }
  .hero p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 40ch; margin: 1.6rem auto 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .hero .cta { margin-top: 2.6rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--line); }
  .strip div { aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--paper-2), var(--rose)); }
  .strip div:nth-child(2) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #efe3da, #c9a86a); }
  .strip div:nth-child(3) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e7d3c9, #8f6f9c); }
  .strip div:nth-child(4) { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f1e4dc, #a98d7e); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  .section { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem); }
  .section h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-align: center; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  .section .sub { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 3rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .menu { max-width: 640px; margin-inline: auto; display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .menu .row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.8rem; }
  .menu .row .nm { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .menu .row .dots { flex: 1; border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--line); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .menu .row .pr { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--muted); }
  .menu .row small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }

  .hours { background: var(--paper-2); text-align: center; }
  .hours dl { max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 0.6rem 2rem; text-align: left; }
  .hours dt { color: var(--muted); }
  .hours dd { margin: 0; }
  .hours .addr { margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--muted); }

  footer.site { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: center; padding-block: 2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
</style>

<div class="demobar">
  <span>DEMO · So könnte die Website für ein <b>Nagel- &amp; Kosmetikstudio</b> aussehen</span>
  <span>
    <a href="/beispiele">← Galerie</a>
    <a href="/#kontakt">Diese Website für meinen Betrieb →</a>
  </span>
</div>

<header class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo">LUMA</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#behandlungen">Behandlungen</a>
      <a href="#studio">Studio</a>
      <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn" href="/kalender">Online buchen</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Nägel · Wimpern · Kosmetik</div>
    <h1>Zeit für <em>sich</em>.</h1>
    <p>Ihr Studio im Herzen von Musterstadt. Ruhig, sorgfältig, mit Termin – ohne Warten.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="/kalender">Termin buchen</a>
      <a class="btn btn--line" href="#behandlungen">Behandlungen &amp; Preise</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="strip" aria-hidden="true"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>

<section class="section" id="behandlungen">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Behandlungen</h2>
    <p class="sub">Auszug aus unserer Preisliste</p>
    <div class="menu">
      <div class="row"><span class="nm">Maniküre klassisch</span><span class="dots"></span><span class="pr">32 €</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="nm">Gel-Nägel Neumodellage</span><span class="dots"></span><span class="pr">55 €</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="nm">Wimpernverlängerung 1:1</span><span class="dots"></span><span class="pr">89 €</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="nm">Gesichtsbehandlung „Glow“</span><span class="dots"></span><span class="pr">69 €</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="nm">Augenbrauen zupfen &amp; färben</span><span class="dots"></span><span class="pr">24 €</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section studio" id="studio">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:640px;text-align:center">
    <h2>Über das Studio</h2>
    <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">&nbsp;</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">LUMA ist ein kleines, inhabergeführtes Studio. Zwei Behandlungsplätze, kein Zeitdruck, hochwertige Produkte. Wir nehmen uns die Zeit, die Ihre Behandlung braucht – und keine Minute weniger.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section hours" id="kontakt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Öffnungszeiten</h2>
    <p class="sub">Termine nach Vereinbarung</p>
    <dl>
      <dt>Dienstag – Freitag</dt><dd>10 – 19 Uhr</dd>
      <dt>Samstag</dt><dd>9 – 15 Uhr</dd>
      <dt>Sonntag &amp; Montag</dt><dd>geschlossen</dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="addr">Musterallee 4 · 12345 Musterstadt · 01234 / 55 66 77</p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.8rem"><a class="btn" href="/kalender">Jetzt Termin buchen</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="site">LUMA Studio · Musterstadt · <a href="/beispiele" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor">Demo von EAN Agency</a></footer>

